ConfirmValidateCampaignTitle = Validate the campaign
ConfirmValidateCampaignText = Validating permanently freezes the campaign: dates, tag, group, voters and their points can no longer be changed. A keypair is generated; the private key will be shown once right after, and is not kept anywhere by Dolibarr. Without it the campaign can neither start nor be tallied. Confirm?
PrivateKeyWarningTitle = Campaign private key -- save it now
PrivateKeyWarningText = This key is shown only once and is not stored anywhere by Dolibarr: without it the campaign can neither start nor be tallied. The key file has been downloaded automatically; if your browser blocked it, use the Download button. Copy it too before leaving this page.
PrivateKeyLabel = Private key (base64)
CopyPrivateKey = Copy
CopyPrivateKeyDone = Key copied to clipboard
