VoteFileDecryptTabText = Drop a vote file downloaded from this campaign: the module checks it is intact and matches the official chain. Decryption becomes possible once the votes are revealed.
VoteFileDecryptTabTextRevealed = Drop a vote file downloaded from this campaign: the module checks it is intact and matches the official chain, then decrypts it with the revealed key.
VoteFileCheck = Check the file
VoteFileCheckAndDecrypt = Check and decrypt
VoteFileNotStored = The file is read then forgotten: it is never kept on the server.
VoteFileGeneratedAt = File generated on
VoteFileChecks = Checks
VoteFileDecryptedVotes = Decrypted votes
VoteFileCheckCampaign = Campaign
VoteFileCheckCampaignOk = The file does belong to campaign %s (same genesis hash).
VoteFileCheckCampaignKo = The file (campaign "%s") does not belong to campaign %s: its genesis hash differs.
VoteFileCheckGenesis = Genesis
VoteFileCheckGenesisOk = The file's genesis matches its hash.
VoteFileCheckGenesisKo = The file's genesis does not match its hash: it was altered.
VoteFileCheckBallotSize = Ballot size
VoteFileCheckBallotSizeOk = Every encrypted vote is %s bytes long: its length gives nothing away.
VoteFileCheckBallotSizeKo = Vote #%s does not have the length fixed by the genesis (%s bytes): non-compliant file.
VoteFileCheckBallotSizeMissing = The genesis fixes no ballot size (ballot_size): non-compliant file, decryption refused.
VoteFileCheckChain = File chain
VoteFileCheckChainOk = The file holds %s vote(s), which form an intact chain from the genesis.
VoteFileCheckChainKo = The file chain is altered: %s.
VoteChainGenesisMismatch = the genesis does not match its hash
VoteChainSeqBroken = the numbering breaks at vote #%s
VoteChainPrevHashMismatch = the link (prev_hash) of vote #%s does not point to the previous vote
VoteChainHashMismatch = the content of vote #%s does not match its hash
VoteFileCheckOfficial = Official chain
VoteFileCheckOfficialOk = The %s vote(s) of the file appear identically, at the same rank, among the %s official vote(s).
VoteFileCheckOfficialOlder = The file was downloaded before the last votes: that is normal.
VoteFileCheckOfficialMissing = Vote #%s of the file is missing from the official chain, which only holds %s votes: a vote vanished from the database, or the file was altered.
VoteFileCheckOfficialDiverge = The file and the official chain part from vote #%s on: one of them was altered.
VoteFileBallotUnreadable = Vote unreadable with this key.
VoteFileBallotWrongSize = Vote of an unexpected size once decrypted: non-compliant file.
VoteFileBallotMisplaced = This vote presents itself as #%s of campaign "%s": it was moved.
ExternalDecryption = External decryption
ExternalDecryptionText = Check and decrypt a vote file of any campaign, even one held on another Dolibarr instance: only the file and the revealed private key are used, nothing is read from the database. Without a key, only the integrity checks are run.
VoteFile = Vote file (.json)
RevealedPrivateKey = Revealed private key
RevealedPrivateKeyHelp = Shown in the campaign's Results tab once the votes are revealed.
ManualDecryptionTitle = Decrypt without Dolibarr
ManualDecryptionText = The vote file can also be checked and decrypted on any computer, without Dolibarr or this module, with the script below. It only needs PHP 7.2 or later with the sodium extension, shipped by default.
ManualDecryptionStep1 = Download the script (or copy it into a file dechiffrer-votes.php) and put it next to the vote file.
ManualDecryptionStep2 = Note the revealed private key in the campaign's Results tab.
ManualDecryptionStep3 = In a terminal, run: php dechiffrer-votes.php FILE.json PRIVATE_KEY
ManualDecryptionStep4 = The script checks the genesis then each link of the chain, and prints each vote in clear: voter, date and points by thirdparty. A link marked "ALTÉRÉE" proves the file was altered.
ManualDecryptionStep5 = To check a vote receipt, with no campaign key at all: php dechiffrer-votes.php FILE.json --recu RECEIPT.json (the private key stays optional and can be added before it, or left out).
ManualDecryptionDownload = Download the script

#
# Tie-break rule, fixed at validation and part of the genesis hash
#
CampaignTieRuleTitle = Tie-break rule
CampaignTieRule_B_E = Share of budget, then verifiable draw
CampaignTieRuleExplanation = In case of a tie on points for a thirdparty: 1) the voter who committed the largest share of their own budget (points bid / points allocated) wins; 2) if still tied, a verifiable draw, derived from the final hash of the vote chain and the thirdparty id, that anyone can recompute. This rule is fixed at validation time and recorded in the genesis hash.

